                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJBxr2NvCrQjQR5Bpsmam9kyw/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2paRVVtRjFjbWxGVUVwdVZHcDZXblZST1dWak0yYxAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "3 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "One of the most satisfying breakfast spots I\u0027ve had in Xinyi District so far! 😍 This time I ordered the crispy assorted egg pancake, Shin Ramyun, mini hot dogs, radish cake, and sweet potato pancake with condensed milk, paired with black tea and soy milk black tea. The whole meal was incredibly abundant! 🍽️✨ The portions were very generous, and I was so satisfied after eating!\n\nI highly recommend their pork chop 🐷🔥. The meat is firm and springy; you can tell it\u0027s not just a mix of cuts! Crispy on the outside, tender and juicy on the inside, the texture is truly amazing! 👏 The Shin Ramyun is also very creative 🍜, with pork chop and egg directly inside. The broth is rich but not overly salty, and the spiciness is just right—perfect for a satisfying breakfast!\n\nThe egg pancake was crispy on the outside, the radish cake was perfectly cooked, and the sweet potato pancake with condensed milk was sweet and comforting 🍠💛. The environment was clean, and the food came out quickly 👍. The prices are reasonable for Xinyi District. This creative brunch spot is so good you\u0027ll want to go back! Highly recommended for breakfast lovers ❤️✨",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "信義區目前吃過最滿意的早餐店之一😍！這次點了酥脆總匯蛋餅、辛拉麵、小熱狗、蘿蔔糕、地瓜拉餅加煉乳，搭配紅茶跟豆漿紅茶，整桌超豐盛🍽️✨ 份量很有誠意，吃完超滿足！\n\n一定要大推他們的豬排🐷🔥，肉質紮實有彈性，一咬就知道不是組合肉！外酥內嫩還有肉汁，口感真的很讚👏。辛拉麵也很有創意🍜，裡面直接加豬排＋蛋🥚，湯頭濃郁卻不死鹹，辣得剛剛好，早餐吃這個超過癮！\n\n蛋餅外皮酥脆、蘿蔔糕煎得恰到好處，地瓜拉餅加煉乳甜甜的超療癒🍠💛。環境乾淨、出餐速度也不錯👍，以信義區來說價格算合理。會讓人想再回訪的一家創意早午餐店，真心推薦給愛吃早餐的人❤️✨",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
                        "authorAttribution":  {
