                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "The dining environment is incredibly soothing, the staff are friendly and provide excellent service, and the food is delicious, especially their homemade chili sauce – a must-try for spicy food lovers! I especially love the restaurant\u0027s slogan, \"Rise \u0026 Shine with Ailai\" (Rise \u0026 Shine with Ailai).",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
